00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.794
And then the Scorpion unit.

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:43.363
So the Scorpion unit was started

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:46.533
on December 1220, 21 in response

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:49.736
to a spate of shootings and violence

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:51.838
gunfire, carjackings,

00:02:52.739 --> 00:02:54.807
car thefts in Memphis.

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:57.177
They put together 50 police officers,

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.344
put them in

00:02:58.344 --> 00:02:59.212
