00:03:15.161 --> 00:03:17.630
They were lauded for picking up

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.400
338 arrests that's a very aggressive

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.868
posture in three weeks

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.703
for 50 police officers.

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.805
195 of those were felonies.

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:28.107
95 of those involved weapons.

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:30.610
And they were being touted

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:33.913
as this is an elite crime fighting unit.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:34.480
That's part of the

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.848
organized crime section.

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:37.650
And then

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:39.919
you have this, which raises the question

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.389
why were officers who had two

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.558
and three years of experience the most?

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:47.527
Six years was the

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:49.629
the most with the most time on.

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:50.997
For those officers

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:52.665
not that experienced,

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:54.934
