00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:56.002
ten or 12

00:03:56.002 --> 00:03:57.203
or 15 year veterans

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:59.672
that go into the specialized units

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:00.306
in a unit

00:04:00.306 --> 00:04:02.875
that was out there in this mission.

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:05.912
And without a supervisor,

00:04:05.945 --> 00:04:07.247
you yeah.

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:08.748
It's a question just for you

