What do they carry?

00:06:22.982 --> 00:06:24.650
What are they facing here?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:24.984
Yeah.

00:06:24.984 --> 00:06:26.252
So a few things

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:28.621
