00:06:49.809 --> 00:06:51.177
the course of conduct,

00:06:51.177 --> 00:06:53.012
it doesn't constitute a crime.

00:06:53.012 --> 00:06:54.313
Why is that significant?

00:06:54.313 --> 00:06:55.214
It's significant

00:06:55.214 --> 00:06:55.782
because it

00:06:55.782 --> 00:06:57.550
then would demonstrate that upon

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.585
an evaluation of that videotape,

00:06:59.786 --> 00:07:01.320
that all of those parties

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.790
charge were active participants

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:06.592
