due to the conduct to your question.

00:07:30.516 --> 00:07:32.485
When you look at the first charge,

00:07:32.485 --> 00:07:33.853
Don, as it relates to the murder,

00:07:33.853 --> 00:07:35.288
I'm sure a lot of people are wondering

00:07:35.288 --> 00:07:36.656
first degree, second degree,

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:38.157
what's the distinction?

00:07:38.157 --> 00:07:39.358
There's two distinctions.

00:07:39.358 --> 00:07:40.326
The first distinction

00:07:40.326 --> 00:07:41.160
is the distinction

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.296
in terms of the level of intent.

00:07:43.563 --> 00:07:44.297
If you charge

00:07:44.297 --> 00:07:45.298
first degree murder,

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:47.400
the prosecutor then has to demonstrate

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.402
you acted with premeditation.

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:50.603
Second degree murder.

00:07:50.603 --> 00:07:51.471
On the other hand,

00:07:51.471 --> 00:07:52.972
you simply have to demonstrate

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:54.474
that it was a knowing killing,

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:55.775
as you heard the prosecutor say.

00:07:55.775 --> 00:07:56.776
What does that mean?

00:07:56.776 --> 00:07:58.878
It means that you have to appreciate

00:07:59.278 --> 00:08:00.279
and know

00:08:00.279 --> 00:08:02.114
that the nature of your conduct

00:08:02.114 --> 00:08:03.349
couldn't cause a death.

00:08:03.349 --> 00:08:05.251
And so the prosecution will argue

00:08:05.251 --> 00:08:07.053
that you can't tell me

00:08:07.053 --> 00:08:09.155
in looking at the video prosecution,

00:08:09.155 --> 00:08:10.289
I'm sure, will say

00:08:10.289 --> 00:08:11.757
as a result of your conduct,

00:08:11.757 --> 00:08:13.092
that you could not appreciate

00:08:13.092 --> 00:08:15.361
that someone might die as a result.

00:08:15.595 --> 00:08:16.762
Very important.

00:08:16.762 --> 00:08:19.131
Right now, you look to the punish ment.

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:20.533
If it were a first degree murder

00:08:20.533 --> 00:08:21.067
charge, it's

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:23.402
a life or life without parole,

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:24.871
