00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:55.067
did you have reasonable suspicion?

00:08:55.067 --> 00:08:56.836
Did you have probable cause?

00:08:56.836 --> 00:08:58.337
Right. We'll find out.

00:08:58.337 --> 00:09:00.573
Whether the stop itself was legitimate.

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:02.909
But even if the stop is legitimate,

00:09:02.909 --> 00:09:04.010
there comes a point

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.378
based upon your conduct

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:07.413
where you could exceed that legitimacy

00:09:07.547 --> 00:09:08.347
by detaining

00:09:08.347 --> 00:09:10.383
someone unlawfully against their will.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.684
And so these charges

00:09:11.684 --> 00:09:13.753
very significant, very important,

00:09:13.753 --> 00:09:15.588
and can land all of these officers

00:09:15.588 --> 00:09:16.923
in jail, essentially,

00:09:16.923 --> 00:09:18.558
if it's 15 to 60 years

00:09:18.558 --> 00:09:20.059
for the rest of their natural lives.

